      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUNEAU SANGRIA (1) was below best at his last start when 6th at this track following a third place finish (25.61) there two back. Has never been out of the placings from five starts out of this box. Ready to return to form. ASTON CASTLE (2) was quickly out of the boxes with a slick early sectional clocking 25.62 with a 2.25 lengths win at this track over 450m. Winner at his latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. One of the prime contenders. PAW HAZELTON (6) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing seventh (25.95) in a Grade 4/5 at Ballarat. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Worth following up. BELAIR LAUREL (3) is worth consideration.",
